#: prefdlg.cpp:850 rc.cpp:334 rc.cpp:682
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Display a notification message whenever an email alarm has queued an email "
"for sending to a remote system. This could be useful if, for example, you "
"have a dial-up connection, so that you can then ensure that the email is "
"actually transmitted."
msgstr ""
"Gifft Bescheed, wenn en Nettpostalarm en Nettbreef en anner Reekner tostüern "
"schull un den Nettbreef de Töövreeg toföögt hett. Dat mag a.B. denn goot "
"wesen, wenn Du en Inwählverbinnen bruukst. Du kannst denn besekern, wat de "
"Nettbreef redig loosstüert warrt."

