#: prefdlg.cpp:1498
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Alarm Message Windows"
msgstr "Alarmbescheed-Finstern"

#: prefdlg.cpp:1508
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>Choose how to reduce the chance of alarm messages being accidentally "
"acknowledged:<list><item>Position alarm message windows as far as possible "
"from the current mouse cursor location, or</item><item>Position alarm "
"message windows in the center of the screen, but disable buttons for a short "
"time after the window is displayed.</item></list></para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wodennig Du verhöden wullt, dat Du "
"Alarmbescheden ahn Willen tofällig beglöven deist:<list><item>dat "
"Alarmfinster so wiet as mööglich weg vun den Muuswieser opmaken, oder</"
"item><item>dat Alarmfinster in de Schirmmerrn wiesen, man de Knööp dor "
"binnen för en korte Tiet na't Opduken utmaken</item></list></para>"

#: prefdlg.cpp:1511
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Position windows far from mouse cursor"
msgstr "Finster wiet weg vun den Muuswieser opmaken"

#: prefdlg.cpp:1515
msgctxt "@option:radio"
msgid "Center windows, delay activating window buttons"
msgstr "Finster in de Merrn, Knööp eerst na Paus anmaken"

#: prefdlg.cpp:1525
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Button activation delay (seconds):"
msgstr "Knööp-Doottiet (s)"

#: prefdlg.cpp:1530
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Enter how long its buttons should remain disabled after the alarm message "
"window is shown."
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du fastleggen, wo lang na't Opduken vun't Alarmfinster de Knööp "
"dor op doot blievt."

#: prefdlg.cpp:1536
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Message windows have a title bar and take keyboard focus"
msgstr "Bescheden hebbt en Titelbalken un köönt den Ingaavfokus kriegen"

#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:80
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (ModalMessages), group (General)
#: prefdlg.cpp:1539 rc.cpp:48 rc.cpp:396
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>Specify the characteristics of alarm message windows:<list><item>If "
"checked, the window is a normal window with a title bar, which grabs "
"keyboard input when it is displayed.</item><item>If unchecked, the window "
"does not interfere with your typing when it is displayed, but it has no "
"title bar and cannot be moved or resized.</item></list></para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Hier kannst Du de Egenschappen vun Alarmbescheden fastleggen:"
"<list><item>Wenn anmaakt, is dat en normaal Finster mit en Titelbalken, dat "
"bi't Opduken den Fokus för Tastatuuringaven kriggt.</item><item>Is dat nich "
"anmaakt, stöört dat Finster Di nich bi't Tippen, wenn dat opdukt, man dat "
"hett denn ok keen Titelbalken un Du kannst dat nich verschuven oder sien "
"Grött topassen.</item></list></para>"

