#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:120
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (EmailClient), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:89 rc.cpp:437
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Email client"
msgstr "Nettpostprogramm"

#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:121
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (EmailClient), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:92 rc.cpp:440
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<para>How to send email when an email alarm is triggered.<list><item>KMail: "
"The email is sent automatically via <application>KMail</application>. "
"<application>KMail</application> is started first if necessary.</"
"item><item>Sendmail: The email is sent automatically. This option will only "
"work if your system is configured to use <application>sendmail</application> "
"or a sendmail compatible mail transport agent.</item></list></para>"
msgstr ""
"<para>Leggt fast, wodennig Nettbreven loosstüert warrt, wenn en "
"Nettpostalarm utlööst warrt.<list><item>KMail: De Nettbreef warrt "
"automaatsch mit <application>KMail</application> loosstüert. "
"<application>KMail</application> warrt toeerst opropen, wenn't noot deit.</"
"item><item>Sendmail: De Nettbreef warrt automaatsch loosstüert. Disse "
"Optschoon funkscheneert bloots, wenn op Dien Systeem <application>sendmail</"
"application> oder en kompatibel Programm inricht is.</item></list></para>"

#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:123
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (EmailClient), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:95 rc.cpp:443
msgctxt "@option"
msgid "Sendmail"
msgstr "Sendmail"

#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:124
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (EmailClient), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:98 rc.cpp:446
msgctxt "@option"
msgid "KMail"
msgstr "KMail"

#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:129
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Base_EmailCopyToKMail), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:101 rc.cpp:449
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Whether to copy sent emails into KMail's Sent folder."
msgstr ""
"Leggt fast, wat loosstüert Nettbreven na KMail sien Loosstüert-Orner kopeert "
"warrt"

#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:130
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Base_EmailCopyToKMail), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:104 rc.cpp:452
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Whether after sending an email to store a copy in KMail's sent-mail folder. "
"Only applies when sendmail is selected as the email client."
msgstr ""
"Leggt fast, wat Nettbreven na't Loosstüern as Kopie binnen KMail sien Orner "
"för loosstüert Nettbreven wohrt warrt. Warrt bloots bruukt, wenn sendmail as "
"Nettpostprogramm utsöcht is."

#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:134
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Base_EmailFrom), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:107 rc.cpp:455
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "'From' email address"
msgstr "De \"Vun\"-Nettpostadress"

#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:135
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Base_EmailFrom), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:110 rc.cpp:458
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Your email address, used to identify you as the sender when sending email "
"alarms. Enter \"@SystemSettings\" to use the email address set in System "
"Settings, \"@KMail\" to allow choice of KMail identities, or enter the "
"actual email address otherwise."
msgstr ""
"De Nettpostadress, de vun Nettpostalarms na't \"Vun\"-Feld inföögt warrt. "
"Mit \"@SystemSettings\" warrt de Adress ut de Systeeminstellen bruukt, bi "
"\"@KMail\" laat sik de KMail-Identiteten utsöken, oder sünst en propper "
"Nettpostadress."

#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:139
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Base_EmailBccAddress), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:113 rc.cpp:461
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "'Bcc' email address"
msgstr "Blindkopie-Nettpostadress"

#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:140
#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (Base_EmailBccAddress), group (General)
#: rc.cpp:116 rc.cpp:464
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Your email address, used for blind copying email alarms to yourself. If you "
"want blind copies to be sent to your account on the computer which KAlarm "
"runs on, you can simply enter your user login name. Enter \"@SystemSettings"
"\" to use the email address set in System Settings, or enter the actual "
"email address otherwise."
msgstr ""
"De Nettpostadress, de en Blindkopie vun de Alarmnettbreven tostüert warrt. "
"Wenn Du Blindkopien Dien Konto op den Reekner tostüern wullt, op den ok "
"KAlarm löppt, kannst Du eenfach Dien Brukernaam ingeven. Giff "
"\"@SystemSettings\" in, wenn Du de Adress bruken wullt, de Du binnen de "
"Systeeminstellen fastleggt hest, oder sünst en anner propper Nettpostadress."

#. i18n: file: kalarmconfig.kcfg:144
